WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.530
Cracked stucco
on your home?

00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:04.290
Need an EIFS crew
for a job?

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.840
We’re Wallder
Construction

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:07.130
in Meriden,
Connecticut.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:09.280
We install and
repair stucco

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:12.210
and take on EIFS
and masonry work.

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:13.480
If you’re dealing
with a leak

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:14.720
or water damage,

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:16.400
we can look at
the stucco with you

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.360
and talk through
what needs repair.

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:20.440
We’ll put the proposal
in writing.

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:21.520
Once you approve it,

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:24.080
we do the work
and leave the site clean.

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.000
For builders and
property managers,

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.440
our commercial work includes

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:31.200
EIFS at the Great Wolf Lodge
hotel and water park.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:32.640
One commercial
customer who

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:34.400
worked with us
on several jobs

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.080
praised our
quick response

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:38.320
and said we met
their schedule dates.

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:40.080
Tell us about
your project.

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:41.640
Call Wallder
Construction at

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:45.200
(203) 565-4719

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:46.367
for a free estimate.
